          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_125",
        on: "new_turn",
        once: true,
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_124",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: 7,
            y: 1,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_127",
        on: "deoran_dialogue",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Deoran, I took an exam on you during my second year at Alduin. Is it true you single-handedly beat down a horde of black-magic bandits and saved the south from destruction? You’re practically a folk hero!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("To some, perhaps. The king was less pleased — Garard is magnanimous towards his favorites, but has little tolerance for failure. I found scant room for advancement within Wesnoth after so much blood spilled in Westin."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("But that all happened many years ago. Ambassador to Lintanir is a prestigious position, in name if nothing else, and an opportunity to exercise what I learned from my time amongst the Aethenwood elves. I have come to value my friends here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("I must confess I look forward to once again marching in company with others of my own ilk, yet still I hope to return to Lintanir once my war-duty is done."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_129",
        on: "new_turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "chantal_dialogue",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_128",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: 16,
            y: 17,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_131_1",
        on: "select",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Chantal",
            text: _("Okay— fine, yes, but Deoran is a good man! Wise and kind, and quietly bearing his burden of exile, so far away from his people? And he’s <i>human</i>! Even a crusty old elf like you has to admit that round ears and stubble are exotic."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("The lives of men burn brightly, but briefly. Even if he returns to Lintanir, what future could you build together? I will not stop you if you want to pursue this, but I know all-too-well the pain from outliving those you love. Cleodil was just as stubborn as you..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_132_2",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Chantal",
            text: _("Okay— fine, yes, but Deoran is a good man! Wise and kind, and quietly bearing his burden of exile, so far away from his people? And he’s <i>human</i>! Even a crusty old elf like you has to admit that round ears and stubble are exotic."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("The lives of men burn brightly, but briefly. Even if he returns to Lintanir, what future could you build together? I will not stop you if you want to pursue this, but I know all-too-well the pain from outliving those you love. Cleodil was just as stubborn as you..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_133_3",
        on: "turn_end",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Chantal",
            text: _("Okay— fine, yes, but Deoran is a good man! Wise and kind, and quietly bearing his burden of exile, so far away from his people? And he’s <i>human</i>! Even a crusty old elf like you has to admit that round ears and stubble are exotic."),
          },
          {
