            text: _("The lives of men burn brightly, but briefly. Even if he returns to Lintanir, what future could you build together? I will not stop you if you want to pursue this, but I know all-too-well the pain from outliving those you love. Cleodil was just as stubborn as you..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_134_4",
        on: "chantal_dialogue2",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Chantal",
            text: _("Okay— fine, yes, but Deoran is a good man! Wise and kind, and quietly bearing his burden of exile, so far away from his people? And he’s <i>human</i>! Even a crusty old elf like you has to admit that round ears and stubble are exotic."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("The lives of men burn brightly, but briefly. Even if he returns to Lintanir, what future could you build together? I will not stop you if you want to pursue this, but I know all-too-well the pain from outliving those you love. Cleodil was just as stubborn as you..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_130",
        on: "chantal_dialogue",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("Chantal, we have much to speak about. It is clear you have feelings for the ambassador. Deoran is no fool; if he does not already know, he certainly suspects."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Chantal",
            text: _("—who? What? Great-Grandfather, I have no idea what you’re talking about."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_135",
        on: "explain_orbs",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Look, the stream is changing direction!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Chantal",
            text: _("Moonstones! Elende, what have you been up to..."),
          },
        ],
